        "original_id": "d4f9202f-3642-5f50-830d-bcca0fa264e9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mitzi Kremer, Dara Torres, Mary Wayte, Laura Walker\n- Events: women's 4×100-meter freestyle relay\n- Organizations: U.S. team\n- Topics: Olympic swimming medals\n\nFacts:\n- Dara Torres was born on April 15, 1967.\n- Dara Torres is an American former competitive swimmer who won twelve Olympic medals and held former world records in three events.\n- Mitzi Kremer won a bronze medal as part of the third-place U.S. team in the women's 4×100-meter freestyle relay.\n- Mitzi Kremer's relay teammates on the bronze-medal U.S. team were Mary Wayte, Dara Torres, and Laura Walker.",
